"The network name. Hidden networks don't broadcast it, and macOS won't reveal it without location permission; both show as “hidden / no permission”." = "網路名稱。隱藏網路不會廣播名稱；沒有定位權限時 macOS 也不允許讀取，兩者都會顯示為「隱藏/無權限」。";
"The MAC address of one AP radio. One SSID can have many BSSIDs (several APs, or one per 2.4/5/6 GHz radio on the same AP). macOS requires location permission to read it." = "AP 某個無線電的 MAC 位址。一個 SSID 可以對應多個 BSSID（多台 AP，或同一台 AP 的 2.4/5/6 GHz 各一個）。macOS 要求定位權限才能讀取。";
"Looked up from the first 3 bytes of the BSSID (OUI) in the IEEE registry. “Guessed” means a virtual BSSID (locally administered address) whose vendor was inferred from the restored OUI and may be wrong; phone hotspots usually use random addresses and can't be identified." = "由 BSSID 前 3 個位元組（OUI）查詢 IEEE 註冊表而得。標示「推測」的是虛擬 BSSID（本機管理位址），廠商由還原後的 OUI 推斷，可能不準確；手機熱點通常使用隨機位址，無法辨識。";
"Authentication / encryption method." = "認證/加密方式。";
"Recommended" = "建議";
"Good (works with older devices)" = "良好（相容舊裝置）";
"Acceptable" = "可用";
"No longer secure" = "已不安全";
"Open" = "開放";
"Unencrypted; traffic can be sniffed" = "未加密，流量可能遭竊聽";
"The newest Wi-Fi generation the AP supports (inferred from its information elements). Newer generations are faster and handle many devices better; actual speed also depends on the client." = "AP 支援的最新 Wi-Fi 世代（由廣播的資訊元素推斷）。世代越新，速率與多裝置效率越高；實際速率還取決於用戶端是否支援。";
"Latest" = "最新";
"Mainstream" = "主流";
"Adequate" = "夠用";
"n (Wi-Fi 4) or older" = "n (Wi-Fi 4) 及更早";
"Legacy; slows down the whole channel" = "老舊，會拖慢整個頻道";
"The country code broadcast by the AP; it determines the allowed channels and maximum transmit power." = "AP 廣播的國家代碼，決定可用頻道與最大發射功率。";
"Infrastructure = a regular router/AP. Ad-hoc (IBSS) = devices connected directly to each other; rare." = "基礎架構 = 一般路由器/AP；點對點 (IBSS) = 裝置之間直接連線的 ad-hoc 網路，較少見。";
"2.4 GHz penetrates walls and reaches far, but has only 3 non-overlapping channels (1/6/11) and lots of interference. 5 GHz has more channels and is faster but weaker through walls. 6 GHz is the cleanest and fastest with the shortest range, and needs Wi-Fi 6E or newer devices." = "2.4 GHz 穿牆能力好、覆蓋範圍廣，但只有 3 個不重疊頻道（1/6/11），干擾多；5 GHz 頻道多、速度快，但穿牆較弱；6 GHz 最乾淨、最快，覆蓋範圍最短，需要 Wi-Fi 6E 以上的裝置。";
"The 20 MHz channel the AP sends beacons on. On 2.4 GHz only 1 / 6 / 11 should be used; other channels interfere with both neighbors." = "AP 傳送信標所在的 20 MHz 頻道。2.4 GHz 應只使用 1 / 6 / 11，其他頻道會同時干擾兩側。";
"The center of the bonded 40/80/160 MHz channel; the spectrum chart is drawn around it. For 2.4 GHz 40 MHz the extension direction is unavailable, so it is estimated." = "多個 20 MHz 頻道綁定成 40/80/160 MHz 後的中心位置，頻譜圖依此繪製。2.4 GHz 的 40 MHz 無法取得擴充方向，為估算值。";
"The center frequency of the primary channel." = "主頻道的中心頻率。";
"The frequency range actually occupied given the channel width. APs whose ranges overlap interfere with each other." = "依頻寬計算出的實際佔用頻率範圍，與其他 AP 有重疊就會互相干擾。";
"Wider channels give higher theoretical speed but overlap neighbors more easily and tolerate interference worse." = "頻寬越寬，理論速率越高，但更容易與鄰近網路重疊，抗干擾能力也更差。";
"20 MHz recommended" = "建議 20 MHz";
"80 MHz typical; 40 MHz when crowded" = "常用 80 MHz；擁擠時 40 MHz";
"160 MHz is common too" = "160 MHz 也很常見";
"How often the AP broadcasts beacons; 1 TU = 1.024 ms. The default of 100 TU almost never needs changing; too small wastes airtime, too large hurts discovery and power-save wakeups." = "AP 廣播信標的週期，1 TU = 1.024 ms。預設為 100 TU，幾乎不需要更改；過小會浪費空中時間，過大會影響裝置探索網路與省電喚醒。";
"RSSI, the received AP signal power in dBm; closer to 0 is stronger. Every 3 dB is a doubling of power." = "RSSI，即接收到的 AP 訊號功率，單位為 dBm，越接近 0 越強。每相差 3 dB，功率相差一倍。";
"Excellent: full speed" = "優秀：全速";
"Good: video calls and 4K are fine" = "良好：視訊通話、4K 都沒問題";
"Fair: fine for browsing, slower speeds" = "普通：日常上網可以，速率下降";
"Weak: stutters and slowdowns" = "較弱：容易卡頓、掉速";
"Poor: frequent disconnects" = "很差：經常斷線";
"Background noise on the channel; lower (more negative) is better. CoreWLAN only measures the connected network; others show “—”." = "該頻道上的背景雜訊，越低（越負）越好。CoreWLAN 只會測量目前連線的網路，其他網路顯示「—」。";
"Quiet" = "安靜";
"Some interference" = "有些干擾";
"Noisy (microwaves, Bluetooth, wireless cameras, …)" = "雜訊大（微波爐、藍牙、無線攝影機等）";
"SNR = signal strength − noise. It reflects real-world experience better than signal alone: a strong signal with high noise still won't be fast. Only available for the connected network." = "SNR = 訊號強度 − 雜訊，比單看訊號更能反映實際體驗：訊號再強、雜訊也高，速率依然上不去。只有目前連線的網路可以計算。";
"Excellent: highest modulation rates" = "優秀：可達最高調變速率";
"Good" = "良好";
"Fair: noticeably slower" = "普通：速率明顯下降";
"Poor: unstable" = "較差：不穩定";
"Very poor: barely connects" = "很差：幾乎無法連線";
"Min / average / max signal sampled over the last 5 minutes of this session. A spread over 10 dB means the signal is unstable (people moving, obstructions, AP power changes, …)." = "本次執行期間最近 5 分鐘取樣的訊號最低/平均/最高值。最高與最低相差超過 10 dB 表示訊號不穩定（人員走動、遮蔽、AP 調整功率等）。";
"When this BSSID was first seen in this session." = "本次執行中第一次掃描到此 BSSID 的時間。";
"Other APs on the same primary channel. Co-channel APs take turns using the air (CSMA/CA); if they can hear each other they queue, so the more there are, the less airtime each gets." = "主頻道相同的其他 AP。同頻道的 AP 會輪流佔用空中時間（CSMA/CA），彼此能聽到就得排隊，數量越多，每個 AP 分到的時間越少。";
"Idle" = "空閒";
"Somewhat crowded" = "有些擁擠";
"Crowded; consider changing channel" = "擁擠，建議更換頻道";
"APs whose occupied frequencies overlap (including co-channel). Partial overlap is worse than sharing a channel: the APs can't coordinate and just see each other as noise." = "佔用頻率有重疊的 AP（包含同頻道）。部分重疊比同頻道更糟：彼此無法正常協調，只能將對方視為雜訊硬撐。";
"The number of associated clients the AP reports in its BSS Load element. Many home routers don't broadcast it." = "AP 在 BSS Load 資訊中回報的已關聯用戶端數量。許多家用路由器不會廣播。";
